1. Hardware protocol knowledge (RTL2832U + R820T2/R828D/E4000/FC00xx)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Realtek and Rafael Micro publish no public programming documentation for
these parts. The register addresses, bit fields, initialisation sequences,
PLL divider arithmetic, gain-step tables, IF/HP filter bandwidth tables and
tuner probe order implemented here are facts about the silicon, established
publicly by the Osmocom rtl-sdr project and the wider community:

